    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VR Slugger: The Toy Field</h2><br>The best VR batting experience ever!<br>Welcome to the Toy Field! You will play against the robot pitcher who can throw a nasty breaking ball. But don't be afraid! Pick your bat! Swing big! Knock it out of the park! Find out secret triggers in the field and achieve high scores ever!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play ball in the toy baseball field. The concept inspired by Japanese old board game: Yakyuban.<br></li><li>Easy to learn physics based batting system.<br></li><li>Legend Mode: Facing these legend pitchers, beat them all!<br></li><li>Puzzle Mode: Testing your batting skill. Hit the ball to the target. Complete all the puzzles to unlock the golden bat!<br></li><li>Time Attack: Hit home run as you can in 30 seconds. Climbing to the top of the world leader board!<br></li><li>Over 10+ unique bats. Unlock them all!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VR Slugger: The Toy Field</h2><br>The best VR batting experience ever!<br>Welcome to the Toy Field! You will play against the robot pitcher who can throw a nasty breaking ball. But don't be afraid! Pick your bat! Swing big! Knock it out of the park! Find out secret triggers in the field and achieve high scores ever!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play ball in the toy baseball field. The concept inspired by Japanese old board game: Yakyuban.<br></li><li>Easy to learn physics based batting system.<br></li><li>Legend Mode: Facing these legend pitchers, beat them all!<br></li><li>Puzzle Mode: Testing your batting skill. Hit the ball to the target. Complete all the puzzles to unlock the golden bat!<br></li><li>Time Attack: Hit home run as you can in 30 seconds. Climbing to the top of the world leader board!<br></li><li>Over 10+ unique bats. Unlock them all!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The best VR batting experience ever! Welcome to the Toy Field! You will play against the robot pitcher who can throw a nasty breaking ball. But don't be afraid! Pick your bat! Swing big! Knock it out of the park! Find out secret triggers in the field and achieve high scores ever!",
